  "articleContent": "<div>\n<div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">Loading Data&gt;&gt;&gt;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"1\" data-line=\"true\">✦Suisui✦</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"2\" data-line=\"true\">Born into a noble family of Mingting, she is the brilliant young director of the Zhaoming Commerce Guild. Wielding a water fan, she weaves business deals into a grand tapestry of trade. Though she knows no swordplay, her financial mastery stitches together a lasting peace for the world.<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1784822400000/bf7bns1taqiqke56cp-1784890636855.jpg\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1784822400000/jutedulnjqfje3dkfj-1784890678064.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"1556\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1784822400000/xrp6s5ijyj3yffnen7-1784890963181.gif\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1784822400000/fl5jv7c28b17xin5wg-1784890734538.gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"1341\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"2\" data-line=\"true\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1784822400000/tf0hp2q1cvsq44ji8a-1784891032130.gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"842\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"